{
 "meta": {
  "about": "People the roster book must not use as players on these dates: vlr.gg lists them on the club's staff (coach, head coach, assistant coach, analyst, manager), and they took the server only to stand in. Their statlines stay in the raw data; they give no roster seat, rating or book entry inside a stint. Each person was checked seat by seat against his vlr team history.",
  "dates": "from/to are YYYY-MM and cover whole months; null is an end vlr does not give (joined in / left in)",
  "source": "vlr.gg player pages, team history with role labels",
  "checked": "2026-09-16",
  "readBy": "scripts/staff.py (build_circuit.py, build_timeline.py, build_world_2021.py), src/engine/staffStints.ts, scripts/check_staff.ts",
  "people": "One row per person, beside his stints. `played` is whether he was ever a professional player at all — false is a man vlr only ever lists on a staff, and he is never in the player pool on any day. `coachFrom` is the month he went to a staff and never went back on a roster: from its first day he is never in the pool again, whether or not a stint covers that day. A man still playing has null, and so does one whose last playing month cannot be pinned down — he is kept out only inside his stints, as before (see `note`)."
 },
